  &reftitle.examples;



    $GLOBALS को उदाहरण


<?php

function test()
{
    $foo = "local variable";

    echo '$foo in global scope: ' . $GLOBALS["foo"] . "\n";
    echo '$foo in current scope: ' . $foo . "\n";
}

$foo = "Example content";
test();

?>


    &example.outputs.similar;


$foo in global scope: Example content
$foo in current scope: local variable







    PHP 8.1.0 देखि पूरै $GLOBALS array मा सिधै write access समर्थित छैन:

     पूरै $GLOBALS मा write गर्दा error आउनेछ।


<?php

// Generates compile-time error:
$GLOBALS = [];
$GLOBALS += [];
$GLOBALS =& $x;
$x =& $GLOBALS;
unset($GLOBALS);
array_pop($GLOBALS);
// ...and any other write/read-write operation on $GLOBALS

?>

  &reftitle.notes;
  &note.is-superglobal;

   Variable को उपलब्धता


    अन्य सबै superglobals भन्दा
    फरक, $GLOBALS PHP मा सुरुदेखि नै उपलब्ध रहँदै आएको छ।





    PHP 8.1.0 देखि, $GLOBALS अब global
    symbol table को एक
    read-only copy बनेको छ। अर्थात्, यसको copy मार्फत global variables लाई
    modify गर्न सकिँदैन। पहिले $GLOBALS array PHP arrays को
    सामान्य by-value व्यवहारभन्दा बाहिर रहन्थ्यो र यसको copy मार्फत नै global
    variables लाई modify गर्न सकिन्थ्यो।



<?php

// Before PHP 8.1.0
$a = 1;

$globals = $GLOBALS; // Ostensibly by-value copy
$globals['a'] = 2;
var_dump($a); // int(2)

// As of PHP 8.1.0
// this no longer modifies $a. The previous behavior violated by-value semantics.
$globals = $GLOBALS;
$globals['a'] = 1;

// To restore the previous behavior, iterate its copy and assign each property back to $GLOBALS.
foreach ($globals as $key => $value) {
    $GLOBALS[$key] = $value;
}

?>
